WEBVTT

00:11:29.416 --> 00:11:31.322
We gathered up our materials,

00:11:31.346 --> 00:11:33.967
and we went out of the room
and counted to a half hour.

00:11:33.991 --> 00:11:34.993
(Laughter)

00:11:35.017 --> 00:11:38.312
Back into the room,
we say, "Hi, we're back."

00:11:38.336 --> 00:11:41.988
The patients, bless them,
say, "Ah, Doc, I'm sorry,

00:11:42.012 --> 00:11:44.242
I've got a memory problem;
that's why I'm here.

00:11:44.266 --> 00:11:46.297
If I've met you before, I don't remember."

00:11:46.321 --> 00:11:49.796
"Really, Jim, you don't remember?
I was just here with the Monet prints?"

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:52.012
"Sorry, Doc, I just don't have a clue."

00:11:52.036 --> 00:11:53.620
"No problem, Jim.

00:11:53.644 --> 00:11:55.893
All I want you to do is rank these for me,

00:11:55.917 --> 00:11:59.513
from the one you like the most
to the one you like the least."

00:11:59.966 --> 00:12:01.117
What do they do?